# The design lab's generated artifacts. The corpus is reproducible from its
# seed in seconds and the plain-run set is a cache of the catalogue; neither is
# worth a megabyte in the history. Verdicts are the one part that is somebody's
# judgement rather than machine output, so they are NOT ignored.
